Bind Npc 14431 Zone 2
Quest 264 "Uruk Blade Hunt"
    Journal "[Guard] Beth has commissioned you to hunt the Uruk Blade."
    Kill 20 of 1693, 9717 at direction_550

Requires player level >= 56 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 25000000 experience

direction_550 = location "Uruk Blade" about "Uruk Blade\nA high-level orc race inhabiting the continent of Adonis; distinguishing trait: strong Attack Power" found "El Morad Eslant" at 380 1642 in zone 2

On offer
    Say "Uruk Blades are advancing toward this region after having killed people at the village entrance. I knew orcs were strong and brutal but I never imagine it would be to this extent. Please help me."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_550
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Don't tell me you're planning on facing them alone.\n\nIf you do a favor for [Guard] Beth, you will be rewarded."

On claimable
    Show quest "I don't know how to thank you. This is compensation for your help. This is all I can give you."
